    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9de028c9e460b33538c9715f",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "即便大家都已经快要力竭倒下了，但还是闪闪发光呢！\r\n就算浑身都覆满了沙尘，但她们全力奔跑的身姿依然那么美丽——",
      "source_fingerprint": "cdf4cb7db5fab4488410f74d795ce8a7dbfdcfb17766f06a8bc8ff8c09eb083b",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1046/storytimeline_041046004.json",
      "json_path": [
