      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        13,
        "name"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/13/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0a77824314c6b4b9c9ec21dc",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "啊……原来是这样呀。\r\n马娘偶像能绽放那样的光芒……是因为她们在全力奔跑。",
      "source_fingerprint": "5e58fd1c4f426edba5bd4838a8530adec3a5e1a2f0b2a60bb2915f69ae4d7309",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1046/storytimeline_041046004.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        13,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/13/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a1f6bc71097fc293fd962349",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "醒目飞鹰",
      "source_fingerprint": "bb8018c249226ea876eeb5e8d071221a5848be1adb4b103c686c1c89ba93746d",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1046/storytimeline_041046004.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        14,
        "name"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/14/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:495282938c6f45881efea18b",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "因为拼尽全力才夺得胜利，所以歌唱时才会让人感动……\r\n我真的非常感动哦。我所憧憬的，就是那样的马娘偶像！",
      "source_fingerprint": "ed170a5a9a677d6955dc323ddad3897507fe1997b969026c738427aee8a106d7",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1046/storytimeline_041046004.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        14,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/14/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:00ee0321a008ffab3e771545",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "醒目飞鹰",
      "source_fingerprint": "bb8018c249226ea876eeb5e8d071221a5848be1adb4b103c686c1c89ba93746d",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
