    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bedd46a0347b7c6bfe275014",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "就算在沙土跑道上胜出，也无法感动他人……\r\n所以才决定挑战草地……哈啊～真是对自己失望透顶啦。",
      "source_fingerprint": "56511827320de655bfa28a475067b59b0f2997cb199c7c5f439dd057969b75db",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1046/storytimeline_041046004.json",
      "json_path": [
