    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1cafe5bf41bdc8973d8a9277",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "现在……总之，今天我能看见这样的舞台，非常开心哦！\r\n我终于注意到了最为重要的事情，我真的非常开心。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d48555ccf154e9dfa36b9b407488b197ea6fd9fa02a75eb3f4c80e352ddedfad",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1046/storytimeline_041046004.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
