      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/18/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:efcf0960ada20c6c6180744a",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "但是……大家并不会像我这样，被其他人带来看这场比赛。\r\n因为沙土跑道的关注度一直都很低，所以大家都会错过这么热情的Live。",
      "source_fingerprint": "6722d5c1a35929aa067d0fda6b84378927879e4631b1db8a5212b7bb3b8d3d58",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1046/storytimeline_041046004.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        18,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/18/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3dff01a1ae80ac75e3315f3c",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "那你将沙土比赛推上顶尖不就好了吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "659660d860931a635403e0e891dbc2c63248265ba49e00084627587c8b22285e",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1046/storytimeline_041046004.json",
