    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:058f06d625bc857c84f8eaf6",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "……您一定是想告诉我选择沙土跑道的好处吧？\r\n那样的话，选一些更大型的比赛应该会更好哦。",
      "source_fingerprint": "a271bce5306b24865aed08b7a9d8f990e0ce13ff15acfd9a080c76b3aeb1dc2a",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1046/storytimeline_041046004.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        2,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/2/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c2cedf497bbc692d7985cb85",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "你说过，不想被『适性』所束缚对吧？",
      "source_fingerprint": "c431590bcebc2de90f1cb9ee2a701570dbf1540dba0c78bc9702e07f535c9d9f",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
